{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to experience high speed arcade-style racing action! Easy to learn\u2026impossible to master!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Goal: Earn the title of the quickest airborne Speed Freak! It will take a lot more than fancy flying, quick reactions, sheer nerve, and skill to win here\u2026you gotta be Plane Crazy! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane Crazy features nine beautifully rendered 3D rendered race-courses. Each with dramatically different landscapes and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional environmental effects like crosswinds and down-drafts present tough challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different classes of aircraft. All customizable to meet the varying demands of each race-course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three intensely addictive modes of play: Quick Race, Ghost Race and Championship Race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your hottest plane from Single-Player mode and use it to blow away the competition in live, head-to-head Multi-Player battle races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eight unique power-ups as you fly and use them to boost your speed\u2026or blow your opponent apart.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780660?t=1760321915","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780660/b9995d9e6d9c2172834a1e19664c751b0ad28b1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760321915","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780660/38d5c27f7bed06831bbc2653d2b282e37810f644/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760321915","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780660/38d5c27f7bed06831bbc2653d2b282e37810f644/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760321915","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>What's New in this re-release of Plane Crazy</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane Crazy Championship Edition is the latest version of the game, including all officially released tracks and languages on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for high resolutions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern gamepad support.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional quality of life configuration options:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-skip all intros.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invertible Y-Axis when using gamepads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent first person cockpit view option.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern system compatibility and crash fixes, ensuring the game runs smoothly on today\u2019s hardware and operating systems.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to experience high speed arcade-style racing action! Easy to learn\u2026impossible to master!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Goal: Earn the title of the quickest airborne Speed Freak! It will take a lot more than fancy flying, quick reactions, sheer nerve, and skill to win here\u2026you gotta be Plane Crazy! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plane Crazy features nine beautifully rendered 3D rendered race-courses. Each with dramatically different landscapes and hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional environmental effects like crosswinds and down-drafts present tough challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different classes of aircraft. All customizable to meet the varying demands of each race-course.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three intensely addictive modes of play: Quick Race, Ghost Race and Championship Race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your hottest plane from Single-Player mode and use it to blow away the competition in live, head-to-head Multi-Player battle races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect eight unique power-ups as you fly and use them to boost your speed\u2026or blow your opponent apart.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Inner Workings","Jordan Freeman Group","SegaSoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780660/0190c5317204becbd27ab454d0204da1f73b5b9b/header.jpg?t=1760321915","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"A game originally developed by Inner Workings. Published by Funbox Media, LTD and Jordan Freeman Group, LLC (DBA: ZOOM Platform). \u00a9 2022-2025 Funbox Media, LTD and Jordan Freeman Group, LLC (DBA: ZOOM Platform) \u2013 All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3780660/398686644/1053f79040e60c38d75f6e1a0e0281403f754910/1758789461/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759118622","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3780660/398686644/1053f79040e60c38d75f6e1a0e0281403f754910/1758789461/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759118622","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3780660/398686644/1053f79040e60c38d75f6e1a0e0281403f754910/1758789461/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759118622","id":257203765,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203765/ceaf095522e9c43448470009571e3acbd1563923/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759118622"}],"name":"Plane Crazy Championship Edition","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0